Obtain cookies from your browser stores
Version test (commit: abc123)

Use with the following flags:
  -d, --domain string    cookie domain filter (partial). Required
  -b, --browser string   The browser you want to obtain cookies from (default "chrome")
  -c, --curl             outputs a curl command using all valid existing cookies for domain
  -e, --expired          show expired cookies
  -f, --full             outputs full information about each cookie
  -z, --fuzzy            enable fuzzy search for all cookies of a domain (requires fzf)
  -n, --name string      prints only the value of the given cookie (exact name match)
  -v, --version          display version information
  -l, --log-debug        logs cookie store errors, which are usually safe to ignore
  -h, --help             display usage information
